  "description": "Simple, stylish, and designed for easy everyday riding, the Hazel is a versatile hybrid bike perfect for getting around town, cruising through parks, or enjoying relaxed weekend rides. Its lightweight 6061 alloy frame provides a comfortable and efficient ride, while the low-step design makes mounting and dismounting effortless. Finished with a wicker-style basket and rear rack, it’s as practical as it is charming, ideal for carrying essentials on the go.\n\nEquipped with easy-to-use Microshift twist-shift gearing and a simple 7 speed cassette, the Hazel makes light work of varied terrain and gentle inclines. The 700x40c tyres add comfort and stability across roads and paths, while reliable V-brakes ensure confident stopping power. With its blend of comfort, practicality, and classic styling, this bike is a great all-round companion for everyday cycling.",
